        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "ruby",
        "cut": "oval",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "Julie Walters"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "She was wearing diamond earrings that she had borrowed.",
