        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "stone",
        "stone": "diamond",
        "cut": "pear",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "One was gone"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "She joked that the earrings probably cost the same as her house.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
